    "text": "If the fourth term in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>7</mn></msup></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4480</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math> is equal to:"
